 <div class="dtexp-head"><h2>Expansion is down — largely a deliberate pricing pullback</h2><span class="dtexp-per">Discussion topic · 1/3 · Pricing · budget TRM</span></div>
 <div class="dtexp-body">
  <div class="dtexp-eye">Structural movement of the existing base · by semester · % of start MRR · <b style="color:#3aa88f">budget TRM (FX-neutral)</b> · excl. new logos &amp; churn</div>
